* Final actual SK stage, worst adjacent sample 2.8V -> 0.2V
* ADC simplified switch (1k on) + sample capacitor. Does not model actual SAR conversion kickback.
.include vendor/combined-namespaced.lib
VS AVDD 0 DC 3
VMID VMID 0 DC 1.5
VIN prior 0 SIN(1.5 0.15 1000)
R1 prior a 22.6k
R2 a plus 22.6k
C1 a out 1n
C2 plus VMID 1n
RG minus VMID 10k
RF out minus 12.4k
Xfinal plus minus AVDD 0 out TLV9052_TLV9052
RISO out adc 150
CRES adc 0 470p
CSAMP held 0 5p
VPREV prev 0 DC 2.8
Sprev held prev cp 0 SAMPSW
Sacq held adc ca 0 SAMPSW
VCP cp 0 PULSE(1 0 1u 1n 1n 1.856u 33.333333u)
VCA ca 0 PULSE(0 1 1.1u 1n 1n 1.656u 33.333333u)
.model SAMPSW SW(Ron=1k Roff=1e12 Vt=0.5 Vh=0)
R1Q prior aq 22.6k
R2Q aq plusq 22.6k
C1Q aq outq 1n
C2Q plusq VMID 1n
RGQ minusq VMID 10k
RFQ outq minusq 12.4k
Xquiet plusq minusq AVDD 0 outq TLV9052_TLV9052
RISOQ outq adcq 150
CRESQ adcq 0 470p
RADCQ adcq heldq 1k
CSAMPQ heldq 0 5p
.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
tran 5n 400u 0 10n
wrdata adc-stress/track_1000Hz_adc5.csv v(out) v(adc) v(held) v(outq) v(adcq) v(heldq)
quit
.endc
.end
